		{
			dependencies: ["134D9801D13D58F5"]
			description: [
				"*&4[Warning !!] &fCompleting this quest will permanently grant the &6divine ascension &fbuff, kill &4descended cisco &ffirst &fto gain &5fallen ascension &finstead.*"
				""
				"During my journey to the &5fallen realm &fin search of a way to defeat &4the Fell King &fi stumbled upon his soldiers mining a mysterious &0dark crystal. &fUpon thorough examination it dawned on me that it was indeed the source of his immense &cpower."
